1207 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Naxatra Labs Pvt\056 Ltd\056 is a deep\055tech hardware startup building high\055efficiency motors and controllers for electric vehicles\054 power tools\054 drones\054 and agri\055tech applications\056 Located in Ahmedabad\054 we specialize in both R\046D and manufacturing of advanced drivetrain systems\056 We are a fast\055growing team working on cutting\055edge technology with real\055world impact\054 aiming to reduce energy consumption\054 drive sustainability\054 and enable global hardware innovation from India\056\240)
     /K [ 2 ]
