  << /ActualText (The Design \046 Development Engineer will be responsible for understanding application requirements and converting them into feasible\054 manufacturable product solutions\056 The role involves end\055to\055end ownership of product development \024 from concept\054 feasibility analysis\054 and prototyping to testing and validation support\056\240This is a high\055ownership role suited for engineers who can independently drive projects without hierarchical supervision\056 \240)
