1219 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\240\nTranslate application and performance requirements into detailed mechanical designs\056\240\nDevelop innovative product architectures for electric motors and related systems\056\240\nCreate high\055quality 3D models\054 assemblies\054 and manufacturing drawings using CAD tools \050SolidWorks \057 Creo \057 equivalent\051\056\240\nApply DFMA \050Design for Manufacturing \046 Assembly\051 principles to ensure feasibility\054 cost efficiency\054 and ease of production\056\240\nImplement and interpret GD\046T standards for precise manufacturing and tolerance control\056\240\nLead rapid prototyping cycles including design iterations\054 fitment checks\054 and functional validation\056\240\nWork closely with Testing \046 Validation teams to analyze prototype performance and refine designs\056\240)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1220 0 R
     /Pg 1165 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
